	// Android Enterprise, Windows Autopilot. `link` — a link or QR handed to a person. `own_device` —
	// your own device. `server` — a server, by an install command and a one-time code. `chromebook` —
	// through the Chrome Enterprise connection. `screen` — screens and signage players. `one_job_thing`
	// — printers, routers, cameras, door readers and bridges. `by_hand` — one device entered as a
