	// WithdrawRetirementAsk Take your own ask to retire a record back
	//
	// "THE ASKER MAY TAKE IT BACK" (the spec lane's ruling of 20 October 2026, on ONPLO-2908). The ask
	// is answered `withdrawn`, and the record stays active, as it was.
