	// ONLY YOUR OWN, AND ONLY WHILE IT WAITS. An ask somebody else made is refused `not_your_ask`;
	// none, or one already answered, is `no_retirement_waiting`.
	//
	// "WIPE A DEVICE", ASKED OF THIS DEVICE, as asking was. Holding it on the device, or on a group
	// the device is in, is enough. No passkey is re-asked: taking an ask back deletes nothing. ONE
