	// StopEnrolmentLink Stop an enrolment link before it expires
	//
	// "STOP A LINK BEFORE ITS EXPIRY — it takes no more devices, and nothing already enrolled through
	// it is touched." It cannot be opened again: make a new one.
	//
	// A LINK THAT IS NOT OPEN IS ANSWERED AS IT STANDS, and nothing is written: one already stopped,
	// one past its expiry, and one whose uses are spent take no more devices already.
	//
	// Corresponds with POST /enrolment-links/{enrolment_link_id}/stop (the `StopEnrolmentLink` operationId).
