	//
	// MAKING ONE PROTECTS NOTHING YET. "Saving applies nothing": a setup reaches a device when a
	// version of it is applied (`applySetup`).
	//
	// IN A COMPANY IT IS YOURS ALONE until it is promoted (`promoteSetup`): a setup made here in a
	// business account environment answers `its_maker_alone` until then. In a personal account
	// environment there is nobody to keep it from.
