	// at a connection, and an operation asks at most one beside its own (decision 0657). Take the
	// item off Required with `updateSoftwareItem`, move it with `moveSoftwareItemToConnectedStore`,
	// and make it Required again (`connected_store_item_has_its_own_operation`).
