	// MakeSoftwareItemRequired Make a software item Required
	//
	// "MAKING AN ITEM REQUIRED installs software, so it also asks for the push permission" (decision
	// 0721 rule 1): `devices:software-item.deploy` beside changing the item, every time. From then
	// on it installs at each device's next check-in wherever it is applied.
	//
	// A BLOCKED ITEM IS NOT MADE REQUIRED here: it has no source to install. Change it to available
	// to install with a source first (`software_item_is_blocked`). One that is Required already is
	// answered as it is, and nothing is written.
