// GetManagedAndCompliantCondition Whether a device is managed and compliant, and why not
//
// "THE MANAGED-AND-COMPLIANT CONDITION: one computed yes/no per device, published for other apps
// to read — this device is enrolled in THIS account environment, its health reads Compliant, and
// its last check-in is inside the environment's freshness window." Keys' company rule "Autofill
