// ListGroups The groups you may see
//
// ONE ROW PER GROUP: its name, whether it is static or smart, and how many devices it holds.
// Groups are the named sets that setups, software and update schedules point at.
//
// ONLY WHAT YOU MAY SEE. A group takes the standard levels every shareable thing in Onplo
// has (Jonas, 2026-10-02), so one you hold nothing on is not in this list — absent, never
// masked.
//
// EACH GROUP IS ASKED ABOUT, NEVER THE WHOLE ACCOUNT ENVIRONMENT. Seeing groups can be given
