	// ExportDevicesAsCsvWithResponse Export the register as CSV, in the filter and the columns on screen
	//
	// "EVERY LIST AND REPORT EXPORTS EXACTLY WHAT IS ON SCREEN — THE CURRENT FILTER AND COLUMNS",
