	// THE LINK IS READ AGAIN, AND ITS USE COUNTED. A link that took its last device, expired or was
	// stopped since this enrolment started finishes nothing (`enrolment_link_used_up`,
	// `enrolment_link_expired`, `enrolment_link_stopped`), and neither does one whose door was shut
	// (`enrolment_door_shut`). One that is still open counts this device, in the same step that writes
	// it, so a link never enrols more devices than its `max_use_count`.
