	// NO LINK'S SECRET PART IS HERE, AND NO ONE-TIME CODE. Each was shown once, in the answer that
	// made the link, and only a hash of each is kept. To show a QR again, make a new link.
	//
	// A BUSINESS ACCOUNT ENVIRONMENT'S, as the doors are. ASKED ACROSS THE ACCOUNT ENVIRONMENT.
	//
	// Returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
