	// SilenceGroupMonitorWithBodyWithResponse Silence a monitor on one group for a maintenance period
	//
	// THE SAME SILENCE AS `silenceDeviceMonitor`, ON ONE GROUP: "A silence covers one monitor on one
	// device, or on one group". It holds for every device that is in the group while the period
	// lasts, the ones that join after it was asked included, and for none that leaves. The answer is
	// the silence as kept.
