	// SET THE ALERT LEAD TIME, in whole days from 1 to 365. A date already said is not said again;
	// one that comes inside the new lead time is said at the worker's next pass.
	//
	// A CHANGE TO WHAT IT ALREADY HOLDS WRITES NOTHING, and is answered as it stands.
