	// "SAVE YOUR OWN FROM ANY FILTERED LIST": the register's filter as it stands, and the columns
	// to show. It is yours alone from the moment it is saved.
	//
	// THE FILTER IS EVERY ONE OF THE REGISTER'S (`ReportFilter`, ONPLO-4155), AND NEVER "HELD BY". A filter naming a person would be that
	// person's data inside your report, and no page says what forgetting them does to it
	// (ONPLO-2489). A group named here and deleted later leaves the report empty, never wider.
	//
	// A FILTER THE REGISTER WOULD REFUSE IS REFUSED HERE, so a report can always be opened. A
