	// drifts. Recommend applies once." Its health word is judged from that version's Required
	// rules from the first report after it, and a reading made before is not judged again.
	//
	// A DEVICE IS ASKED ABOUT ONE BY ONE. Seeing a device can be given on one device alone, so the
