	// ListUpdateSchedulesWithResponse The update schedules
	//
	// ONE ROW PER SCHEDULE: who gets an operating-system update when, how long it may wait, and
	// by when it must be installed. "A schedule says WHO, and its Speed says HOW FAST."
	//
	// THE THREE THAT SHIP ARE ALWAYS HERE: Test devices at Fast, Everyone at Standard and Servers
	// at Careful. Every account environment has them from its first device, and `shipped_as`
	// says which is which whatever each has been renamed to.
	//
	// ASKED ACROSS THE ACCOUNT ENVIRONMENT. The catalogue gives seeing the schedules at the
	// environment and on no single schedule, so whoever may see one sees all of them, in the
	// order they were made.
	//
	// Returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
