	// SPEED AND DAYS MOVE TOGETHER, as when a schedule is added. Changing the speed to `fast`,
	// `standard` or `careful` sets both numbers; `custom` needs both, sent now or already held.
	//
	// A GROUP IS ASKED ABOUT ONE BY ONE. Seeing a group can be given on one group alone, so the
	// door asks which of the groups named you may see (`devices:group.read`, decision 0752), and
	// one you may not see answers exactly as one that does not exist.
