	// PreviewUpdateScheduleDeletionWithResponse What deleting an update schedule would do
	//
	// "DELETING ONE PREVIEWS WHAT IT DOES FIRST: how many devices move, and what their new
	// deferral and deadline become." Nothing is changed by asking.
	//
	// A DEVICE MOVES WHEN THIS IS THE SCHEDULE IT FOLLOWS NOW. Its groups "move to Everyone",
	// so it follows Everyone afterwards — "unless another schedule also names" it through
	// another group, and then it follows that one. The two are counted apart, and Everyone's two
	// numbers are answered beside the first.
