// takes only its name and its tags"). They stay notes on the archive. A change to any other
// field is refused `device_is_retired` and nothing is changed, its name and tags included. A
// field sent with the value it already holds is no change, and is not refused. A recycled
// device, which was retired first, is refused the same.
