// `assigned`: ASSIGN and REASSIGN "take a device from ENROLLED or ASSIGNED to ASSIGNED". A device
// in repair, in lost mode or retired is refused, naming its state. A hand-over already waiting
// is replaced by this one, and the person it named is no longer asked.
//
// THE PERSON IS A MEMBER OR A GUEST OF THIS ACCOUNT ENVIRONMENT, by id; anybody else is refused
// at `/body/person_id`.
//
// ONE DEVICE, ITS OWN PERMISSION, ASKED OF THIS DEVICE. ONE AUDIT RECORD naming who handed it
// to whom. Identity is told nothing: a company's device is the account environment's whoever
// holds it.
