// TrySoftwareInstallAgainWithResponse Try a failed install on a device once more
//
// "TRY AGAIN IS A PERMISSION OF ITS OWN, given on one device or on all of them. It installs
// nothing new: the device tries the same item once more at its next check-in" (ONPLO-3663).
//
