// FAILED ATTEMPTS, counted from the number it had failed when it was cleared, and it reads
// `update_failing` again. Cleared twice, the count starts from the second.
//
// A CLEARANCE GOES WITH ITS UPDATE: once the update is installed and leaves the device's
// report, nothing of the clearance is kept.
