// in is held by nobody yet. Zero-touch hands out per programme, so naming either on the zero-touch
// door is refused (`zero_touch_hands_out_per_programme`) — set the programme.
//
// A CHANGE TO WHAT IT ALREADY HOLDS WRITES NOTHING, and is answered as it stands.
