// ListEnrolmentLinksWithResponse The enrolment links
//
// "A LINK OR QR YOU HAND TO A PERSON." Every link made in this account environment, open or not,
// in the order they were made: "A link that is expired or out of uses is listed as such, with
// 'Make a new one' beside it." `state` says which.
//
// SEEING THEM ASKS "SEE THE ENROLMENT DOORS", because a link is a row of the Links & codes door
// (the spec lane, 21 October 2026, ONPLO-2950).
//
// NO LINK'S SECRET PART IS HERE, AND NO ONE-TIME CODE. Each was shown once, in the answer that
// made the link, and only a hash of each is kept. To show a QR again, make a new link.
