// FOR A SERVER'S ENROLMENT THAT IS STILL OPEN. One of another door has no code and is
// refused `enrolment_door_mismatch`; one that is finished or cleared is refused as such.
//
// ONE PART IS NOT BUILT YET: for a server's enrolment that is still open it answers 501 and
// no code is made, because the answer carries the install command (ONPLO-2329). Every
// refusal above is served.
